      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would love to see this.\n\nThere could also be a similar alternate solution achieved by vibrating the left and right controllers based on which ear the voice activity is coming from and changing the vibration strength based on how loud it is. It wouldn't be as granular of a solution as something like a circular HUD with profile icons but I think it could make for a really solid second option for those who don't want more things on the UI.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-26T20:14:03.141Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "My hearing ability is not good, so I often struggle to find where someone speak to me. Thus I would appreciate to have VRChat to have show which direction the voice comes from on HUD. I think it should help many people having difficulty on hearing.\n\n私は耳があまり良くないので、他人に話しかけられたとき、どこに相手がいるのか探すのに苦労しています。なのでHUD上に、話しかけられた方向を表示できる機能を追加していただけるとありがたいです。その機能は聴覚に問題を抱えた人々を救うことになるはずです。",
